<title>MEXICO: Telmex Q3 results detailed.</title>
<headline>Telmex Q3 results detailed.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican telecommunications firm Telefonos de Mexico S.A. released the following details from third quarter earnings.</p>
<p>All figures are in millions of Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>				   Q3 1996	Q3 1995	PCT DIFF</p>
<p>INCOME</p>
<p>    Int'l long-distance    3,583	  2.980	  20.2</p>
<p>    Domestic l-distance    3,976	  3.360	  18.3</p>
<p>    Local service	    5,286	  4.974	   6.3</p>
<p>    Others			 470	    638	 (26.3)</p>
<p>    Total		     13,315	 11,952	  11.4</p>
<p>EXPENSES</p>
<p>    Cost of sales	    3,131	  2,469	  26.8</p>
<p>    Cost of admin	    2,710	  1,809	  49.8</p>
<p>Depreciation,</p>
<p>    amortization	     2,378	  2,030	  17.1</p>
<p>    Total			8,219	  6,308	  30.3</p>
<p>  OPERATING PROFIT	   5,096	  5,644	  (9.7)</p>
<p>COST OF FINANCING</p>
<p>    Net interest		  27	  (369)	   n.a.</p>
<p>    F/X gain		     178   loss  586	    n.a.</p>
<p>    Monetary gain		215	   617	   65.2</p>
<p>    Total			  366	   400	   (8.5)</p>
<p>  PRE-TAX EARNINGS	   5,462	  4,998	 (19.8)</p>
<p>  TAXES			  1,902	    560	 239.6</p>
<p>  NET PROFIT		   3,560	  4,438	 (19.8)</p>
<p>LINE GROWTH</p>
<p>	 (in thousands)</p>
<p>    Total lines in service 8,851	  8,774	   n.a.</p>
<p>	  Quarterly change    (18)	     48	   n.a.</p>
<p>LONG-DISTANCE MINUTES</p>
<p>	 (in millions)</p>
<p>    Domestic long-distance 2,037	  1,840	   10.7</p>
<p>    Int'l long-distance	940	    781	   20.5</p>
<p>-- Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9565</p>
